\cf2 Ezekiel is diagnosing the behavior as fundamentally pathological. The extreme sexual language isn't just metaphor for political alliances - it's showing that their relationship with foreign powers exhibits the same compulsive, degrading, self-destructive pattern as sexual addiction.\
The disgust all parties feel (Jerusalem disgusted with Babylon, YHWH disgusted with Jerusalem, yet she continues) shows this has moved beyond rational choice into compulsion that persists despite revulsion.\
This is why the underage prostitution imagery matters at the beginning - the pattern was established when they were vulnerable, young, and it's become ingrained, escalating, impossible for them to stop on their own.
