"I will cause your lewdness to cease from you, and your prostitution from the land of Egypt; you will not lift your eyes to them, and Egypt you will not remember anymore."\
Where Ezekiel typically concludes with the recognition formula - 
\f3 \uc0\u1493 \u1460 \u1497 \u1491 \u1463 \u1506 \u1456 \u1514 \u1462 \u1468 \u1501 
